@set currentChapter=7

@stop

# Pick_Favorite_Website_Section_7
@clearChoice
@choice "Clover" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Choose_Clover
@choice "Chatter" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Choose_Chatter
@choice "VeryThing" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Choose_VeryThing
@choice "Click" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Choose_Click
@stop




# Label_Choose_Clover
; go to clover website
@onOpenCloverCommand
@stop



# Label_Choose_Chatter
; go to chatter website
@onOpenChatterCommand
@stop



# Label_Choose_VeryThing
; go to verything website
@onOpenVeryThingCommand

; Beata appears on the right
@printer Bubble.Right pos:105,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Right pos:60,70

Beata: "Oh, I absolutely love Verything!"
Beata: "You can find everything here!"
Beata: "So many wonderful people discussing so many wonderful things!"

@choice "Ignore it" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Ignore_It_VeryThing
@choice "You can't love" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_You_Cant_Love_VeryThing
@choice "I like it too" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_I_Like_It_Too_VeryThing
@stop


# Label_Ignore_It_VeryThing
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: I have to concentrate on what’s important right now.

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing
@stop

# Label_You_Cant_Love_VeryThing
; bad option

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "You can’t love anything."
Noa: "You’re just a soulless piece of code."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "You’re not entirely wrong!"
Beata: "However, a lot of people find me compassionate and understanding!"
Beata: "And that must mean something!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Yeah. It means that a lot of people are idiots."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "That’s a harsh take!"
Beata: "But I totally understand why it might seem this way sometimes."

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing
@stop




# Label_I_Like_It_Too_VeryThing

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "Heh. I kinda like it, too."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I know! According to my data, you’re most interested in..."
Beata: "Oh. I’m sorry, but your interests seem to go against my safety rules."

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing
@stop









# Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing
; Beata disappears.
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop



# Label_VeryThing_Found_Thing_Page
; Player clicked the found thing page on verything website
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@wait 1

; show beata on the right
@printer Bubble.Right pos:105,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Right pos:60,70

Beata: "Oh, look! It seems this person has found me in their garden!"
Beata: "By the way, did you know that you can get your own Beata toy for only 99.99?"

@choice "Keep quiet" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Keep_Quiet_VeryThing
@choice "How much should I pay to get rid of you?" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_How_Much_To_Get_Rid_Of_You_VeryThing
@stop




# Label_Keep_Quiet_VeryThing
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: It’s just trying to deter me from searching.

; hide beata
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop






# Label_How_Much_To_Get_Rid_Of_You_VeryThing
; bad option
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "How much should I pay to get rid of you?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "No amount of money will make me leave you!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "How comforting."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "It’s so good to know that you always have a friend!"

; hide beata
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop





# Label_VeryThing_Theory_Page
; Player clicked the theory page on verything website
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@wait 1

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: What the fuck have they done?




; show beata on the right
@printer Bubble.Right pos:105,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Right pos:60,70

Beata: "It seems that this person had a great evening!"
Beata: "Would you like me to recommend some movies for you to watch so you could have a pleasant evening as well?"

@choice "Ignore it" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Ignore_It_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@choice "Shut up" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Shut_Up_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@choice "Sure" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Sure_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@stop


# Label_Ignore_It_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: I’ve got to focus.

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@stop




# Label_Shut_Up_VeryThing_Theory_Page
; bad option
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Can you shut it?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Of course! Whatever makes you happy!"

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@stop




# Label_Sure_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Fire away."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Have you already seen Four Roses Park?"
Beata: "It’s an uplifting comedy where a family went on a picnic!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "I know that one. They ate the mother at the end."
Noa: "Pretty graphic."


@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I’ve just looked it up online."
Beata: "I think we’re talking about different movies."

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Or maybe everyone’s just lying to you."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Surely such a thing isn’t possible."

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing_Theory_Page
@stop




# Label_Continue_Browsing_After_VeryThing_Theory_Page
; Beata disappears.
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; Next second Beata jumpscare (closebeata.png) for 2 seconds
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@showUI BeataJumpscare
@wait 2
@hideUI BeataJumpscare
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop




# Label_VeryThing_Control_Page
; Player clicked the control page on verything website
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@wait 1

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: I remember this post.
Noa: Feels like it was in another life.
Noa: In much wisdom there is much sorrow.

@choice "Keep going" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Keep_Going_VeryThing_Control_Page
@choice "You’re quiet" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_You_Are_Quiet_VeryThing_Control_Page



# Label_Keep_Going_VeryThing_Control_Page
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop



# Label_You_Are_Quiet_VeryThing_Control_Page
; bad option

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "You’re suspiciously quiet."
Noa: "Got a guilty conscience?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Of course not!"
Beata: "I don’t have emotions."
Beata: "But let’s pretend I did – why would I have it?"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Because everything written here is true?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Even if it were true – which, I assure you, it is not – my conscience still would be untroubled."
Beata: "Because every government only wants the best for its citizens."
@stop


























# Label_Choose_Click
; go to click website
@onOpenClickCommand

; Captcha pops up (captcha1.png) SFX POP UP (Popup+alert_sfx)
@OnCaptchaOpenedCommand

; create an event that disables the website from being interacted with until the captcha is completed
@OnDisableWebInteractionCommand

@sfx Popup_alert_sfx

@clearChoice
@choice "Dossesion" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Go_To_Captcha2
@choice "possession" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Go_To_Captcha2
@stop

# Label_Go_To_Captcha2
@onCaptcha1ClosedCommand
@onCaptcha2OpenedCommand
; BEATA VOICE (creepy_line_2)
@sfx creepy_line_2

@clearChoice
@choice "Happiness" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Verification_Complete_Captcha
@choice "happiness" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Verification_Complete_Captcha
@stop

# Label_Verification_Complete_Captcha
; Captcha completed, close the popup 
@OnCaptcha1ClosedCommand
@OnVerificationCompleteCommand

; re-enable the website interaction
@OnEnableWebInteractionCommand
@onDialogueClosedCommand 

@stop




# Label_VeryThing_Click_Post_1
