@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop





# Label_No_VeryThing_Click_Post_1
; bad option
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "You do understand that this is just a bunch of AI’s bullshit?"
Noa: "A twisted version of reality."
Noa: "It used to be something along the lines of, “Crying is fine.” Or whatever."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Crying is an important emotional response indeed!"
Beata: "But wouldn’t it be better if everyone were happy?"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Better? Maybe. Impossible? Definitely."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Nothing is impossible with the right mindset!"

; hide beata
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop




# Label_Kinda_VeryThing_Click_Post_1
