Noa: "I’m not into all that motivational bullshit, but sure."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Perhaps you simply haven’t found the right motivational quote yet!"
Beata: "Would you like me to make a list for you?"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "I’ll pass."

; hide beata
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
