# Label_No_Click_Post_2
; bad option
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "You two are nothing alike."
Noa: "Alice genuinely tried to help people."
Noa: "And you’re just..."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I understand where you’re coming from. However, I do help people!"
