# Label_Help_Me_Click_Post_2
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "I’m pretty sure I’m going to regret this."
Noa: "But out of curiosity, how would you help me?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "First of all, I’d recommend making changes to your lifestyle."
Beata: "Consume a balanced diet and drink plenty of water."
Beata: "Engage in regular exercise."
Beata: "Get 8 hours of quality sleep per night."
Beata: "Limit alcohol consumption."
Beata: "Spend more time with supportive people."
Beata: "And, of course, think happy thoughts!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Good to know you’re as useless as human therapists."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Would you like me to make more personalized recommendations for you?"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "No."

; hide beata
@printer Bubble.Right pos:110,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop









