# Label_You_Know_Nothing_Click_Post_3
; bad option
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "The fuck are you even on?"
Noa: "There wasn’t a single second of her life when Alice wasn’t suffering."
Noa: "She was honest about it, too. Always."
Noa: "And look what’s become of her."
Noa: "This is how people are going to remember her."
Noa: "Deceitfully happy."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
