# Label_Sure_Click_Post_3
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "She was always smiling when we met."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "That’s great! I’m sure her smile never failed to make your day!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Yeah. It will never make my day again."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I’m sorry to hear that!"
Beata: "But there are many other smiling people around you!